cter\":\"Barro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uIHk5ODiTFp79tZphgjhuOERbpm.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"WKBhdtHPIv4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"iUI27J2H5pE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3bUg1r5ZKTc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3uKa53KhCmQB38ZdpClLldXclbS.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Fly Baby Fly\",\"overview\":\"Keko is on a plane with his gang: off to freedom! Barely in the air, Stulle and Pepsi have to force the diamonds they swallowed out into the toilet. Now the fight over the loot begins. When Barro goes for his throat, Keko collapses. An emergency, an emergency landing—and nerves are frayed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5kObpVNfxOg8IuzdPMZfMgg2EaN.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Sayorana\",\"overview\":\"Stulle, Pepsi, and Barro want to sell the diamonds. Their friend Giovanni knows who can take the hot goods: Japanese men who run a bar near the Dutch border...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1UNDleoJApmQylDKQ11ApTKpa0h.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"runtime\":15},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Chaos\",\"overview\":\"Counterfeit money! Stulle, Pepsi, and Barro are furious! They get guns from the fence Ruslan. But the Japanese are already expecting them...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6SR7J6J9wMVvnSIIptngDjHeguk.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Harakiri\",\"overview\":\"Billy makes a deal with her Interpol friend Enie: The Berlin \\\"Brothers\\\" belong to her, and the Yakuza belong to the Dutch investigator. The skin is now divided, but the bear is far from done for!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Vz0yrRGkQz3Mbujo1pKJrmt1yZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Déja-Vu\",\"overview\":\"Stulle, Pepsi, Barro, and Giovanni are doubly trapped: The Yakuza are in charge in the karate bar, and the police are outside. A hopeless situation? Nothing new! Now it's time for some surprising moves.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/870AM1Ac6ELR4vXNb13u0YMf69l.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"runtime\":13},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"El Clasico\",\"overview\":\"With his back against the wall, Pepsi senses a big deal: a Fabergé egg worth millions is hidden in the bar. He wants to find it with Stulle and Barro. Interpol agent Enie also has her eye on the treasure.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5g7oj091awpGjyDXo6cMVDjPXs2.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-25\",\"runtime\":15}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2024-02-02\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}